                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is a weird, satisfying little indie puzzle platformer about a beaver called Bernard.\n\nI really love the transformation of the gameplay between the 3 main worlds, going from simple puzzle solving, to difficult puzzle solving and then to a combination of puzzle and tough, yet satisfying platforming.\n\nOverall, it's a short and fun little game, and every little victory is greatly satisfying.\n\nIn my opinion, it's worth the tiny price tag.",
